cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use artifacts-mmo-mcp or the traces it produces, please
  cite it using the metadata below.
title: "artifacts-mmo-mcp"
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-08-31"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/weftspun/artifacts-mmo-mcp"
url: "https://github.com/weftspun/artifacts-mmo-mcp"
abstract: >-
  MCP server that plays ArtifactsMMO and records two trace layers
  for the taskweft HTN planner: the plan calls that chose each
  action, and the game API requests that carried them out, joined
  on run_id and step. Serves an unauthenticated spectator page
  showing what every character is currently doing.
authors:
